OL,3,GNEWSA'Dark day for Lewis' as one
OL,4,Afisherman dead and two missing
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice say a body has been found in the
OL,7,Fsearch for three men who were onboard a
OL,8,Ffishing boat that has gone missing off
OL,9,Fthe Western Isles.
OL,11,FThe Maritime and Coastguard Agency
OL,12,F(MCA) said the alarm was raised about
OL,13,F21:20 on Tuesday when it emerged the
OL,14,Fboat, called the Kilda, was overdue
OL,15,Ffrom Lewis.
OL,17,FA plane, two helicopters, two lifeboats
OL,18,Fand volunteers searched off the Port of
OL,19,FNess in north Lewis. Police have warned
OL,20,Fthe public not to make their own
OL,21,Fsearches due to bad weather.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
