OL,3,GNEWSA'Dark day for Lewis' as one
OL,4,Afisherman dead and two missing
OL,5,
OL,6,FLocal councillor Kenneth Macleod said
OL,7,Fit was a "very dark day" for islanders,
OL,8,Fand their thoughts were with the
OL,9,Ffamilies of the three men, and First
OL,10,FMinister John Swinney said his heart
OL,11,Fwent out to those involved.
